# The ability sacrifices both of Bot1's lands as it resolves, then searches for at most two lands. Bot2's Mountain is not a
# legal sacrifice; choosing two of the many Forests exposes the exact "that many" ceiling and both arrive tapped (CR 608.2c-d,
# 701.21a, 701.23b). Two Bot1 Forests supply {G}{G} and three Pearls supply {3} exactly.

